{"id":"c96ab493df8372c8","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-fraisse-limit.md","title":"Fraïssé Limit Existence and Uniqueness","display":"thm-fraisse-limit — Fraïssé Limit Existence and Uniqueness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-fraisse-limit","aliases":["17-thm-fraisse-limit"],"display":"thm-fraisse-limit — Fraïssé Limit Existence and Uniqueness","depends_on":["[[17-df-fraisse-class]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-isomorphism]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-5.4.2b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-fraisse-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-fraisse-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fraisse-limit — Fraïssé Limit Existence and Uniqueness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc4d04472af291f6\" href=\"?note=fc4d04472af291f6\" title=\"17-df-fraisse-class\">17-df-fraisse-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-5.4.2b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc4d04472af291f6\" href=\"?note=fc4d04472af291f6\" title=\"17-df-fraisse-class\">17-df-fraisse-class</a> 所规定的可定义结构元类；可数性是同构类型代表集合的可数性，不断言同构封闭的全部结构组成一个集合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FraisseClass}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{FraisseClass}_L\\)</span> (Fraïssé-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc4d04472af291f6\" href=\"?note=fc4d04472af291f6\" title=\"17-df-fraisse-class\">17-df-fraisse-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Age}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Age}_L\\)</span> (age of a structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fc4d04472af291f6\" href=\"?note=fc4d04472af291f6\" title=\"17-df-fraisse-class\">17-df-fraisse-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocallyFinite}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{LocallyFinite}_L\\)</span> are the ultrahomogeneity and local-finiteness predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc4d04472af291f6\" href=\"?note=fc4d04472af291f6\" title=\"17-df-fraisse-class\">17-df-fraisse-class</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (structure isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|\">\\(|\\cdot|\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (cardinality and least infinite cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FraisseClass}_L(K)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl[\n&amp;\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Age}_L(\\mathfrak M)=K\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L(\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\operatorname{LocallyFinite}_L(\\mathfrak M)\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak N|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Age}_L(\\mathfrak N)=K\n\\land\\operatorname{LocallyFinite}_L(\\mathfrak N)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L(\\mathfrak N)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak N\\cong\\mathfrak M\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FraisseClass}_L(K)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl[\n&amp;\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Age}_L(\\mathfrak M)=K\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L(\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\operatorname{LocallyFinite}_L(\\mathfrak M)\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak N|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Age}_L(\\mathfrak N)=K\n\\land\\operatorname{LocallyFinite}_L(\\mathfrak N)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L(\\mathfrak N)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak N\\cong\\mathfrak M\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is a local supplementary Fraïssé theorem, not a statement verified against a matching passage in Chang–Keisler. Its existence proof enumerates countably many finite isomorphism types and finite embedding-extension tasks, then applies amalgamation to construct a chain of finite structures meeting every task. The union is locally finite and homogeneous. For uniqueness, enumerate the two carriers; local finiteness places the current finite substructure and the next element together in a finite substructure. Equality of ages and homogeneity extend the current finite isomorphism. Alternating the two sides yields a total isomorphism.</p>\n<p>Local finiteness is essential for the stated function-language version. In the language of one unary function, let <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> be all nonempty finite structures satisfying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)=x\">\\(f(x)=x\\)</span>. A countably infinite identity-function structure and its disjoint union with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb Z,n\\mapsto n+1)\">\\((\\mathbb Z,n\\mapsto n+1)\\)</span> have the same finite age and are both homogeneous for finite substructures, but are not isomorphic. The added condition excludes the second structure.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The limit is unique among at-most-countable locally finite ultrahomogeneous structures with age <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>. If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> has structures of arbitrarily large finite size, the limit is countably infinite.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-fraisse-class","status":"resolved","id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-fraisse-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f3187e8ff79e64e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-fraisse-class","status":"resolved","id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ 是 [[17-df-fraisse-class]] 所规定的可定义结构元类；可数性是同构类型代表集合的可数性，不断言同构封闭的全部结构组成一个集合。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-fraisse-class","status":"resolved","id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FraisseClass}_L$ (Fraïssé-class predicate, see [[17-df-fraisse-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-fraisse-class","status":"resolved","id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Age}_L$ (age of a structure, see [[17-df-fraisse-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-d